make("jaguar","Jaguar","F-Pace, XF, XE, E-Pace, F-Type, I-Pace",
"Jaguar specialist in Dubai — JLR SDD diagnostics, air suspension expertise, ZF gearbox service.",
"Jaguar vehicles combine British style with modern performance, and the F-Pace and XF are among the most popular premium SUVs and saloons in Dubai. Modern Jaguar vehicles use sophisticated electronics, air suspension systems and ZF gearboxes that require specialist diagnostic equipment to service and repair correctly.<br><br>FixHive uses JLR-compatible SDD (Symptom Driven Diagnostics) tools giving full access to all Jaguar modules. Our technicians have experience across the full Jaguar range including air suspension repair, ZF 8-speed gearbox service and ADAS calibration.",
"Jaguar Air Suspension Faults","Air suspension on the F-Pace, XF and XJ develops compressor, air bag and height sensor faults — particularly under Dubai heat cycles. Symptoms include uneven ride height, prolonged levelling and suspension warning lights. We repair Jaguar air suspension correctly with quality components.",
"Jaguar ZF 8-Speed Gearbox Service","The ZF 8HP automatic gearbox fitted to most Jaguar models benefits from fluid changes at 60,000&ndash;80,000 km in UAE conditions. Harsh shifts, hunting between gears and delayed engagement indicate overdue service. We carry correct ZF-specification fluid.",
"Jaguar Timing Chain Stretch (AJ-V6, AJ-V8)","The 3.0L V6 supercharged and 5.0L V8 engines used in Jaguar models can develop timing chain guide wear at higher mileages, particularly when oil changes are deferred. Cold-start rattling and a stored camshaft correlation code are the warning signs.",
"Jaguar InControl Electronics and Software Issues","Modern Jaguar infotainment and InControl connectivity systems can develop software glitches, touch screen faults and module communication errors. We diagnose and resolve Jaguar electronic faults using JLR-compatible SDD diagnostic tools.",
"How much does a Jaguar service cost in Dubai?","A Jaguar minor service at FixHive starts from AED 700&ndash;1,000. A major service starts from AED 1,400. We always use the correct Jaguar-specification oil &mdash; typically 5W-30 or 0W-20 depending on the engine.",
"Do you have Jaguar diagnostic equipment?","Yes &mdash; we use JLR-compatible SDD diagnostic tools giving full access to all Jaguar modules including engine, gearbox, air suspension, airbags and InControl systems. Not possible with generic OBD scanners.",
"Can you repair Jaguar air suspension in Dubai?","Yes &mdash; Jaguar air suspension repair is one of our specialist services. We replace compressors, air bags and height sensors and carry out the correct calibration after repair.",
"Can you service the Jaguar F-Pace in Dubai?","Yes &mdash; the F-Pace is a regular in our workshop. We service the 2.0T and 3.0T engines, ZF 8-speed gearbox and carry out ADAS calibration and air suspension repair.",
"How often should I service my Jaguar in Dubai?","We recommend 10,000 km or 12-month service intervals in Dubai. ZF gearbox fluid should be replaced every 60,000&ndash;80,000 km and air suspension should be inspected annually.",
'    <a href="brakes.html" class="brand-svc-tile"><span class="svc-tile-icon">💨</span><span>Jaguar Air Suspension Repair</span></a>')

make("mini","MINI","Cooper, Countryman, Clubman, Convertible, Paceman",
"MINI specialist in Dubai — BMW ISTA diagnostics, N18 engine expertise, twin-scroll turbo service.",
"MINI vehicles bring genuine driving pleasure in a compact package, and the Cooper and Countryman are popular in Dubai for their character and practicality. Modern MINIs are built on BMW architecture and share many electronic systems — requiring BMW-level diagnostic expertise to service correctly.<br><br>FixHive uses BMW ISTA-compatible diagnostic tools giving full access to all MINI modules. Our technicians are experienced with the specific requirements of N14, N18 and B38 engines including timing chain awareness and turbocharger maintenance.",
"MINI N18 Engine Timing Chain Issues","The N18 1.6T engine fitted to the Cooper S and JCW models has a known timing chain tensioner issue. Cold-start rattling and rough running are warning signs. If caught early this is a manageable repair — left too long it causes severe engine damage. We replace MINI timing chains correctly.",
"MINI Carbon Build-Up on Turbo Petrol Engines","MINI Cooper S and JCW turbocharged engines use direct injection that allows carbon deposits to accumulate on intake valves. Rough idle, reduced power and hesitation under acceleration are symptoms. Intake cleaning restores performance on affected models.",
"MINI CVT and DCT Gearbox Service","Automatic MINI models use either a DCT (dual-clutch) or torque converter automatic. Both require fluid changes at UAE-appropriate intervals. Jerky shifts and shudder under light acceleration in the DCT indicate clutch wear or degraded fluid.",
"MINI Electrical and VANOS System Issues","The VANOS variable valve timing system on older MINI models can develop solenoid faults and oil pressure issues causing rough idle and stored camshaft codes. Modern MINI models can also develop infotainment and comfort module electrical faults that require BMW ISTA coding to resolve.",
"How much does a MINI service cost in Dubai?","A MINI oil service at FixHive starts from AED 400&ndash;600. A major service starts from AED 900. We use the correct BMW/MINI LL-01 specification oil &mdash; not a generic substitute.",
"Do you have MINI diagnostic equipment?","Yes &mdash; we use BMW ISTA-compatible diagnostic tools covering all MINI modules including engine, gearbox, airbags, comfort electronics and ADAS. The same level of diagnostics as a BMW/MINI dealer.",
"Can you fix MINI timing chain problems in Dubai?","Yes &mdash; MINI N14 and N18 timing chain replacement is within our capability. We replace the chain, tensioner and guides as a complete assembly and carry out the correct engine reassembly procedure.",
"Can you service MINI JCW models in Dubai?","Yes &mdash; the John Cooper Works models with their uprated turbocharged engines and performance brakes are within our capability. We carry the correct oil grade for JCW engines.",
"How often should I service my MINI in Dubai?","We recommend 8,000&ndash;10,000 km oil service intervals in Dubai. MINI turbocharged engines are sensitive to oil quality &mdash; do not extend beyond 10,000 km in UAE conditions.",
'    <a href="diagnostics.html" class="brand-svc-tile"><span class="svc-tile-icon">💻</span><span>MINI VANOS System Repair</span></a>')

