"How often should I service my Volvo in Dubai?","We recommend 10,000&ndash;12,000 km service intervals in Dubai. Timing belt models (B4204T engines) should have the belt replaced strictly at the manufacturer interval &mdash; no exceptions in Dubai heat.",
